  same material one after another: a scale, the 7:4 dyad C-A♯ and the otonal
  tetrad C-E-G-A♯ (4:5:6:7). Values in the guitar, harp, harpsichord and bar
  presets are starting values for listening, not measurements.

  Render with: ./build/synth --stereo --render out.wav songs/additive_presets_demo.xml
-->
